language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Dinner: choose how many grandparents, parents and children go to dinner, with 1 to 6 grandparents, 1 to 10 parents and 1 to 40 children.
$ the number of grandparents
find grandparents : int(1..6)
$ the number of parents
find parents : int(1..10)
$ the number of children
find children : int(1..40)
such that
$ there must be 20 people in total at dinner
grandparents + parents + children = 20,
$ the dinner must cost exactly $20; costs are in cents: grandparents 300, parents 200, children 50
300 * grandparents + 200 * parents + 50 * children = 2000
